    "text": "By Nicholas Gowdy ,\n1 days ago The Miami Dade College women’s soccer team enjoyed a successful first season. They had a 10-5 record, finished the season ranked No. 18 in the nation, posted a 4-1 home mark and made it to the Florida College System Athletic Association semifinals. Now they are looking to build on... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
